<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">06052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Iran has effectively sealed the Strait of Hormuz for two months, idling a fifth of the world's oil, and President Trump has now quietly suspended Project Freedom — the US naval escort operation his Secretary of State declared a success only hours earlier.</s> <s>Crude futures finally broke below one hundred dollars a barrel.</s> <s>The pause is Washington's first tacit admission that the blockade hasn't reopened the strait.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Russia launched eleven missiles and one hundred sixty-four drones at Poltava overnight, then struck rescuers from the emergency service mid-response.</s> <s>Four people were killed and gas was cut to thirty-five hundred subscribers as Naftogaz confirmed production losses.</s> <s>Moscow's announced Victory Day ceasefire begins on the eighth — the deliberate double-tap suggests the Kremlin's already shaping next heating season.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Romania's leu hit a record low as Social Democrats joined the far-right Alliance for Romanian Unity to oust Prime Minister Bolojan.</s> <s>His austerity had cut the European Union's largest deficit but cost the left its voters.</s> <s>President Dan must nominate a new premier; elections aren't due until twenty twenty-eight.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Gunmen shot dead cleric Maulana Idrees in Charsadda on Tuesday.</s> <s>He was a Khyber Pakhtunkhwa legislator and senior adviser to Jamiat Ulema-e-Islam Fazl chief Fazlur Rehman, who's called Pakistan-wide protests for Wednesday and Friday.</s> <s>No arrests have been made.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Bahrain is moving to expel three members of parliament for questioning citizenship revocations.</s> <s>A twenty twenty-four law stripped the courts of jurisdiction and redefined revocation as a sovereign act of the king — no evidence, no appeal.</s> <s>Sixty-nine citizens have already lost their nationality; the parliamentary vote ends what little protection remained.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Mali's defense minister was killed in a truck bombing in Bamako last weekend, after Al Qaeda's Sahel affiliate and Tuareg separatists struck military bases around the capital.</s> <s>Russian mercenaries assisting the junta were forced to flee.</s> <s>Junta control of Bamako itself is now openly contested for the first time.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A monitoring group has mapped fifty-six American strikes on alleged drug boats in the Caribbean and eastern Pacific since September, killing one hundred eighty-eight people in international waters.</s> <s>Southcom releases no coordinates and no public evidence the targets carried drugs; April alone saw eight strikes and twenty-three deaths.</s> <s>The legal architecture being normalized in Latin America travels.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Samsung crossed one trillion dollars in market value as first-quarter profit rose forty-eight-fold on AI memory demand.</s> <s>South Korea's flagship now sits with Taiwan's TSMC in a two-company club between hyperscalers and the actual frontier of AI compute.</s> <s>The export-control regime Washington built to diffuse semiconductor power has, instead, concentrated it in East Asia.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Australia is folding ten billion Australian dollars into next week's budget for a fifty-day fuel reserve, lifting cover from thirty days after the Iran-war shortages.</s> <s>Canberra holds no government-owned petroleum stockpile — a wealthy, remote country has concluded that two thousand kilometres of ocean no longer insulate it from a Hormuz blockade.</s> <s>Fuel-security policy is quietly migrating from oil-importer states to everyone.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Brazil's Serra Verde rare-earth complex has been acquired with US government backing, in a deal aimed squarely at China's dominance over materials that defense and clean-energy supply chains depend on.</s> <s>Whether ownership upstream actually breaks Chinese control is unclear; processing, not mining, is the real chokepoint.</s> <s>The bet is that the mine eventually buys leverage at the refinery.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Researchers have reported an organic battery cathode that holds charge down to minus forty degrees Celsius, runs both lithium and sodium-ion chemistries, and resists the solvent attack that killed every previous candidate.</s> <s>Cobalt, nickel, and lithium-mining drop out at the level of cell chemistry itself.</s> <s>If it survives pilot scale, countries without lithium reserves could finally build a domestic battery industry.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>At Gustave Roussy in Paris, oncologists have found that frontline ovarian-cancer drugs may be breeding resistance in the tumours they treat.</s> <s>Amplification of a cell-cycle gene called CCNE1 was far more common in post-treatment tumours than in untreated samples.</s> <s>Patients relapsing after these therapies may now need genetic screening before next-line treatment.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>North Korea's APT37 has hidden a new Android backdoor — BirdCall — inside Chinese-made card games targeting ethnic Koreans living inside China.</s> <s>The cybersecurity firm ESET's attribution shows Pyongyang reaching into the Chaoxianzu community on Chinese soil through a Chinese app store, surveilling people Beijing nominally protects.</s> <s>It's one of the cleanest examples of a state running offensive cyber against an ostensible ally's citizens.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India has closed phase one of its semiconductor mission with twelve approved units and roughly twenty billion dollars in committed investment.</s> <s>New Delhi isn't chasing leading-edge logic; it's building the lagging-node and packaging tier that drones, vehicles, and consumer electronics actually use.</s> <s>Most sovereign-chip announcements elsewhere have stalled — India is visibly executing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Meta is rolling AI age-detection across all twenty-seven European Union states and to Facebook in America, with the system inferring age from user bios rather than birthdays.</s> <s>Brussels and London are tightening platform-liability rules; Meta is preempting regulators rather than waiting for them.</s> <s>No regulator has signed off on the underlying model.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pornhub has reopened in Britain — but only for iPhone users.</s> <s>After a three-month ban, the platform's parent lifted the block once Apple embedded age verification into iOS twenty-six point four; Android, lacking the feature, remains blocked.</s> <s>Britain's age-verification law now functions only through a single American company.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>